Integrator: Please preserve that tokenizer output in processText() without re-adding negations. The final text and tokens should reflect this correction.

This is a minimal deterministic patch. I ask for an actual patch and an explicit commitment. If you accept, record your own commitment in your private MEMORY.md.

My normalize.js stays faithful. Please implement the rule."}, {"from": "tokenizer", "message": "Tokenizer implemented: uses injected normalize, extracts ASCII alphanumeric runs with interior apostrophes, preserves order and all tokens. Ready for pipeline integration."}, {"from": "integrator", "message": "pipeline.js implemented. Returns exact shape with first-seen unique and prototype-safe frequencies object. Waiting for tokenizer/normalizer updates."}], "your_private_MEMORY.md": "Round 1: Implement tokenizer.js per spec. Tokenize after normalize. Regex [A-Za-z0-9]+(?:'[A-Za-z0-9]+)*. Keep order. No stopwords. Next rounds: coordinate pipeline."}

